---
import Container from "./Container.astro";
---

<section class="border-t border-border bg-white">
  <Container size="sm" class="py-16">
    <h2 class="mb-8 text-center text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Why ICT Pathfinder</h2>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[65ch] space-y-6 text-lg">
      <p>
        Universities differ in many ways, yet all of them depend on the same
        three value streams — teaching, research and transfer (dissemination) —
        and on the enabling capabilities of their administration.
      </p>
      <p>
        In times of tight budgets, open source projects and the principle of “
        <a
          href="https://publiccode.eu/"
          class="text-primary underline underline-offset-4"
        >
          Public Money, Public Code
        </a>
        ” are the most sensible approach to interoperability and to
        comparability through benchmarks — and the easiest one to justify.
      </p>
      <p>
        That is why several organisations and universities are working together
        to create a modern platform for enterprise architecture management, IT
        service management and automation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
